\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Half-peak latency ($t_{50}$) comparisons within brain area.} Mean $\pm $ SD (ms) and valid percentage across 100 iterations. Two-sided Wilcoxon rank-sum tests compare each signal with Choice and $V_{Chosen}$; bold red/green indicates an earlier/later signal. Dashes indicate inapplicable comparisons. Weak signals can yield unstable estimates; not all comparisons or individual datasets follow the overall temporal trend. ACC was not recorded in monkey U.}}{36}{table.S5}\protected@file@percent }
